## Goal

The user must be able to switch between:

- regular map;
- satellite imagery.

This is a base-layer switch only.

Persisted GIS objects and transient application overlays must remain
independent of the selected base layer.

Conceptually:

Leaflet Map
    |
    +-- Base Layer
    |     +-- Regular map
    |     +-- Satellite
    |
    +-- Application Overlays
          +-- persisted Areas
          +-- drawing/edit layers
          +-- historical geometry preview

Switching the base layer must not recreate or mutate Area data.

