## Layer Independence

This is the critical behavior.

Switching:

Map -> Satellite -> Map

must NOT:

- reload Areas from the backend solely because the base layer changed;
- recreate persisted Area state;
- change Area geometry;
- change Area versions;
- make REST mutations;
- emit WebSocket Area events;
- interfere with OCC;
- clear the current viewport unnecessarily.

Base-layer selection is client-side presentation state.

---

## Existing Area Rendering

After switching layers:

- persisted Area polygons remain visible;
- popup behavior still works;
- Area names/data remain unchanged;
- polygon coordinates remain unchanged;
- areaKm2 remains unchanged.

No backend changes should be necessary for this behavior.

